<view class="page"><view class="title">交付与分享</view><view class="intro">文件绑定这份成片。内部清单包含来源、版本和费用记录；对外清单仅保留已批准输出的信息。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="load" disabled="{{loading || busy}}">刷新当前状态</button><view class="card" wx:if="{{report}}"><view class="card-title">{{report.revision_number ? 'v' + report.revision_number : '原始清单'}} · {{report.can_download ? '已批准' : '领取前需通过审核'}}</view><view>{{report.reason}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="compare">与另一版本比较</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="exportFile" data-kind="manifest" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">导出内部审阅清单</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="exportFile" data-kind="manifest" data-visibility="public" disabled="{{busy || pending || !report.can_download}}">导出对外清单</button><view class="actions"><button class="small-button" bindtap="exportFile" data-kind="srt" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">导出 SRT</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="exportFile" data-kind="vtt" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">导出 VTT</button></view><view class="small">字幕文件仅含文字和时间，不含字号、颜色与烧录样式。清单不等于权利验证或C2PA签名。</view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{filePath}}" bindtap="shareFile">选择文件接收位置</button></view>
<view class="card" wx:if="{{report.can_review}}"><view class="card-title">创建受控分享</view><view class="muted">{{configReason}}</view><view class="status" wx:if="{{pending}}">原分享操作尚待核对。<button class="secondary" bindtap="recover" disabled="{{busy}}">核对原操作</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="recover" data-repeat="true" disabled="{{busy}}">沿用原提交继续</button></view><input class="input" value="{{form.label}}" maxlength="120" bindinput="labelInput" placeholder="分享名称" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><picker range="{{audiences}}" value="{{audienceIndex}}" bindchange="audienceChange" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"><view class="input">受众：{{audiences[audienceIndex]}}</view></picker><view class="small" wx:if="{{audienceIndex === 1}}">任何获得链接的人均可在有效期内访问，请核对后再复制。</view><picker range="{{expiries}}" value="{{expiryIndex}}" bindchange="expiryChange" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"><view class="input">有效期：{{expiries[expiryIndex]}}</view></picker><view>允许视频下载<switch checked="{{form.allowDownload}}" data-field="download" bindchange="permissionChange" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/></view><view>包含字幕文件<switch checked="{{form.includeSubtitles}}" data-field="subtitles" bindchange="permissionChange" disabled="{{busy || pending || !form.allowDownload}}"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="createShare" disabled="{{busy || pending || !available || !report.can_download}}">创建新分享</button><view class="small" wx:if="{{url}}">当前链接：{{linkLabel}}</view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{url}}" bindtap="copyLink">复制分享链接</button><view class="small">撤销立即阻止新授权；已签发媒体地址最长5分钟有效且不超过分享期限。已领取文件无法收回。</view></view>
<view class="card" wx:if="{{report.can_review}}"><view class="card-title">分享记录</view><view class="candidate" wx:for="{{shares}}" wx:key="id"><view>{{item.label}} · {{item.statusLabel}}</view><view class="small">{{item.audience === 'workspace' ? '工作空间内' : '持有链接的人'}} · 截止 {{item.expires_at}}</view><view class="actions"><button class="small-button" bindtap="getLink" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy || pending || item.status !== 'active'}}">获取链接</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="revoke" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy || pending || item.status === 'revoked'}}">撤销分享</button></view></view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{more}}" bindtap="moreShares" disabled="{{busy}}">加载更多记录</button></view><view class="status">{{status}}</view></view>
